window.products.push({"id":1076103,"name":"CafePress Fruit Of The Spirit Tote Bag Natural Canvas Tote Bag, Reusable Shopping Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31uRfLvaGXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Your New Favorite Bag: Make a statement with a fun and functional canvas tote bag that shows off your unique personality. This versatile, multipurpose classic is sure to become your go-to reusable, foldable bag that is perfect for shopping, work, or vacation. Two Sizes: Small tote measures 15\" x 15 x 6\" with 26.5\" handles. Medium tote measures 15\" x 18\" x 6\" with 22\" handles. Each tote size features reinforced handles and full side and bottom support gussets for strength and durability. Professionally Printed: Our tote bags are imported from our trusted partners. Then each tote is expertly printed with sharp and vivid graphics using premium inks by our USA printing partner. Our quality totes are built to last: construction, design and graphic design placement. Easy To Care For Eco-Friendly Carryall Option: No need to use more plastic grocery bags, wasteful wrapping paper or other one time use products. Use for everyday errands, to present gifts, stow away items and organize with our minimalist tote bags. Once our cotton canvas bags become soiled, simply spot clean or place in washing machine on your favorite cold setting. Machine dry on low heat or hang dry. Ideal Everyday Tote or Gift : Treat yourself or surprise family members, friends, colleagues or your favorite teacher. Our beautifully designed cotton canvas tote bags make a unique and thoughtful present for Christmas, Easter, Mother's Day, birthdays, back-to-school, weddings, anniversary and so much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31uRfLvaGXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CafePress","source_asin":"B0BHZ6GV65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHZ6GV65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHZ6GV65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1076104,"name":"CSA RAB-101 AirCloud Regency Collection Espresso Caffe/French Vanilla 25\" High Full Size Air Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CPpWT5sLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Regency and SuperbAir series use patented technology to inflate the beds in less than 2 minutes. This AirBed has a powerful internal motor that has been engineered specifically for one purpose that is to fill it fast . The material used for all AirCloud beds is K80-PVC which is the softest and most durable fabric that can be bought. The surface of all beds is velvet finish polyester and is fully washable with a sponge or towel and any traditional fabric detergent. Construction of all AirCloud beds uses state of the art UHF (ultra high frequency) electroweld technology which assures long life and durable seam construction. The AirCloud surface cradles you in velvet comfort. It is difficult to stay awake when you lie down on an AirCloud bed. Bed firmness or softness is adjustable for each individual by means of the Power Control unit that is conveniently located at the side of every AirCloud bed. Firm or soft, your wish is the control's command. For extra comfort a 2-inch pillow-top section is built onto the top of every Regency bed. It's named Regency because you sleep in Royal comfort. Special interior I-Beams control the flow of air throughout the interior chambers of the bed. No lumps or bumps in any AirCloud. There are no special sized sheets or blankets to buy. Just open the box, plug in the power cord, and in less than a few minutes you'll have your full size, adjustable, ready-to-sleep on bed. There are no 6-inch high beds that have your arms lying on the floor in the middle of the night. The Regency bed is the tallest in the industry at 25 inches high. When not in use, the AirCloud bed can deflate quickly with its quick-release air valve and can be stored conveniently in the included nylon carry or storage bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CPpWT5sLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CSA","source_asin":"B004U41YSY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004U41YSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004U41YSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1076105,"name":"8 Pcs Mini Stainless Steel Spoons and Forks Golden Flower Design, 5 Inches for Appetizer Cake Fruit Dessert Tasting Kitchen Accessory Wedding Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QqQiCy-0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🐬Safe and High Quality Material🐬 🌸Excellent food grade stainless steel after strict inspection🌸Healthy, eco-friendly durable dessert flatware spoons and forks Bright Mirror Polished 🌱A classic fashion design along with bright mirror polishing🌱Keep clean and bright for a longer time than others Comfortable Size and Weight 🌵Great choice for having coffee, tea, ,fruity mix, ice-cream, gumbo, porridge and etc🌵In cafes, restaurants as well as home for people of any age Easy wash and maintenance 🍒Remove and buff the dust and dirty on the surface of spoons with soap, detergent or warm water🍒Dishwashing is allowed for these lovely spoon 🐬Enjoy graceful life🐬 A nice present for families, friends and colleagues to celebrate Thanksgiving Day, Christmas Day and so on","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QqQiCy-0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAPPY KIT","source_asin":"B08S788CWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S788CWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S788CWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1076106,"name":"Department 56 Possible Dreams Peanuts Snoopy and Woodstock “Oh What Fun” Clothtique Christmas Figuri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LrvrJZ9uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since 2003, Department 56 artist Ann Dezendorf has led the way in creative direction for the cherished Possible Dreams collection. Possible Dreams uses a unique patented process of sculpting and stiffened fabrics to create multidimensional, lifelike Santa Claus figurines. With designs inspired by Ann’s family and love of Christmas history, these collections capture not only the traditional side of Santa, but also bring light to his off-season hobbies and humorous personality. This time, Santa’s friends at Peanuts star in this 3.5” figurine. Snoopy puts on Santa’s hat and coat to deliver gifts with the help of his little yellow friend, Woodstock. Possible Dreams features handcrafted Clothtique — stiffened fabric and mixed media details — to create beautiful one-of-a-kind treasures. Each piece is hand-painted to provide a distinctive artistic touch of realism, ensuring the highest quality for years to come. All Possible Dreams figurines come boxed in decorative packaging for easy gifting. About Us: Enesco is committed to bringing joy every day. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, plush, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: GUND, Department 56 Village, Gregg Gift, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Walt Disney Archives Collection, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Pusheen, Designs by Lolita, Our Name Is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LrvrJZ9uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B01NCSSBE1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NCSSBE1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NCSSBE1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
