window.products.push({"id":1076152,"name":"Houdini Lever Corkscrew with Foil Cutter and Extra Spiral, Shiny Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MdfgBEO-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Houdini Corkscrew (Shiny Black) is a high-quality lever-style corkscrew and works like magic. Push down, pull up and presto the cork is out of the bottle! Push down, pull up again and sheathe cork is off the corkscrew! Amazon.com Like the handcuff king it's named for, the Metrokane Houdini lever-style corkscrew works so easily it practically defies explanation. The Houdini was designed by the innovative company that created the Rabbit corkscrew, and is both simple and effortless to use. Just close the side handles over the neck of the bottle, pull up, and--voila!--the cork's removed. Another up-and-down movement pops the cork off the corkscrew. Metrokane corkscrews are independently tested for 20,000 cork pulls; tests assume replacement of the spiral after 1,000 pulls. Made with durable all-metal gear parts, the Houdini works with any size wine bottle. Its polycarbonate handles are ergonomically-designed and finished with a polished luster. Metrokane includes a matching foil cutter and a five-year warranty. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MdfgBEO-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houdini","source_asin":"B000068FNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000068FNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000068FNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1076153,"name":"Lenox Holiday Tartan Candle Lamp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EVZGVPS1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description It's a candle... it's a lamp... it's both! Enjoy the best of both worlds - the warm glow of candlelight, the elegance of a decorative lamp - with this original candle lamp. The base and pierced shade are crafted of earthenware, and both bear the festive Holiday Tartan motif. Amazon.com There's something cozy and vital about the flicker of flame at the holidays. When a fireplace is lacking, this candle lamp makes a fine substitute. The two-part ceramic lamp is comprised of a rounded base and integral metal frame that supports the removable shade. Cut-out holly leaves in the shade allow the candle flame to show through and heat to dissipate. Tartan ribbon tied in three bows circles the shade, while the base is decorated with two bunches of holly, fruit, and acorns. Rims are trimmed with 24-carat gold. Coordinating with Lenox's Holiday Tartan dinnerware pattern, the fine china lamp is glazed a warm ivory color. A glass candle holder and a scented votive candle are included with the lamp. Lenox recommends using a votive candle no more than 1-5/8 inches in height with the wick trimmed to 1/4 inch to prevent overheating and smoking. The lamp should be lit only on a heat-resistant surface, away from children and anything flammable. Any smudges on the glossy lamp can be wiped off with ease. The sturdy gift box will also safely store the 10-1/4-by-8-inch lamp for seasons to come. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EVZGVPS1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lenox","source_asin":"B0002W6GOU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002W6GOU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002W6GOU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
