window.products.push({"id":1076245,"name":"ORFELD Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 24000Pa Powerful Suction Stick Vacuum, 50Mins Runtime Cordless Vacuum with Ultra-Quiet Lightweight Vacuum for Home Har","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pWzZ2a1+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【24000Pa Powerful Suction】: ORFELD cordless vacuum cleaner maximum mode can reach 24000Pa powerful suction power, can instantly suck away dirt, debris, pet hair and stains, easy to clean hard floors, carpets and hardwood floors, etc., so you can spend less time to complete the whole house cleaning, leaving more time to enjoy a good life. 【50 Mins Long Runtime】：The cordless stick vacuum has a built-in 7*2200 mAh battery, which can run for 50 minutes in 12000Pa mode and 20 minutes in 24000Pa mode (this data is provided by ORFELD lab). One full charge is enough to clean your bedroom, living room and kitchen. In addition, the battery is designed with overload, overheat and short circuit protection. 【5-Stage High Efficiency Filtration】This cordless vacuum cleaner has a level 5 fully sealed cyclone filtration system, which can capture 99.99% of fine dust as small as 0.1 microns, and discharge clean air after purification. Empty the trash with one click without touching the dust. HEPA filters are washable, reusable, and last twice as long as traditional filtration systems. 【Lightweight & Flexible Electric Brush】： The main body of the hardwood floor vacuum weighs only 3.3 pounds, making it easy to use handheld for long periods of time. The flexible brush that can rotate 180° can easily clean the bottom of the sofa and under the bed, and the LED headlight on the front can help clean poorly lit and dark corners for all-around cleaning, perfect for families with pets and children. 【6-in-1 Multifunctional & Wall Mounted】： The cordless design of the rechargeable vacuum cordless makes it more convenient to use, the 2-in-1 roller brush is suitable for a variety of floors, and the use of the attachment converts it into a handheld vacuum cleaner, easily clean sofas, corners, ceilings and car seats. The wall-mounted storage design makes it easier to charge the hardwood floor vacuum cleaner while taking up less space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pWzZ2a1+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORFELD","source_asin":"B0B23JG8CB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B23JG8CB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B23JG8CB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1076246,"name":"Lorbro Sunglass Organizer Wall Mounted, Sunglasses Holder Wall Wood Rustic Decor, Hanging Eyeglass Storage Organizer for Living Room, Bedroom, Entrywa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X7Efip7RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"More Stable with Gourd Hole: The gourd hole design keeps the sunglass organizer and the wall at the same level, which can fit the wall tightly, making it more stable without shaking and easy to hang. 3 pack sunglass organizer wall mounted with instructions and screws and can be completed install within 5 minutes. Just find the position, fix the screws on the wall, and hang the sunglasses display storage rack wall. All Sunglasses In One Place and Keep Organized: The rustic and stylish sunglass holder wall mounted design can not only decorate your home, but also neatly put all your sunglasses in one place and easy to grab. One hanging eyeglass storage organizer can hold 6 to 7 pairs of sunglasses and quickly find the sunglasses you need to match clothes without rummaging through the box. Save Space and Prevents Scratching Lenses: Sunglass organizer transform wasted wall space into neatly display sunglasses area, easily hang and grab on the rack. Hang in your living room, bedroom, entryway, next to a door, on a wall, apartment, and display in a store. Hang the sunglasses on the wall to prevent scratching the lenses. Durable Pine Wood: Rustic wood sunglass organizer wall mounted is made of premium pine wood and braided string. Suitable for farmhouse, rustic, simple and modern style home decoration. The size of the wood rack is 16\"L x 1.5\"W x 0.5\"H, enough length to store all your multiple sunglasses, each sunglasses holder wall can store 6 to 7 pairs of sunglasses. Wide Range of Uses: The sunglasses holder wall mounted can not only store various sizes of sunglasses, eyeglass, gaming glasses, but also store bow ties, belts and other accessories. Hanging eyeglass storage organizer very easy to find and display sunglasses. Hanging in the entryway, living room and bedroom, it can also be hung in the store to display accessories and so on. The greatest choice as a gift for family, friends to decorate the home and display eyeglasses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X7Efip7RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lorbro","source_asin":"B0BKZB1T9C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZB1T9C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZB1T9C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
