window.products.push({"id":1076409,"name":"Knife Handle Japanese Kitcken Knife Repair Handle for Nakiri Knife Natural Wood Handle Replacement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+lu+au8RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"・You can replace the handle of a dirty or broken Nakiri knife after using it for many years. ・Used when replacing the handle of an old Japanese Nakiri knife. It cannot be used for anything else. ・ Check the image for the size of the mounting part. ・ Dishwasher and dish dryer cannot be used. ・Since natural wood is used, mold and corrosion will occur if stored in a wet state. ・Be very careful when installing. Incorrect installation may result in serious injury or serious accident.   Repair method 1. Remove the handle from the old kitchen knife. If there is rust, remove it. 2. Check the size of the hole in the handle before installing. * Do not attach a kitchen knife that does not match the size. 3. If the hole is a little big, inject adhesive into the hole before installing. Fill the gaps in the mounting area with adhesive. 4. Hit the bottom of the handle with a mallet or plastic hammer. The blade goes into the handle. (* Please do not use a hammer. The handle will crack) 5. Start using after the adhesive has hardened.   Warning ・ Please use after understanding the repair method. ・ Install correctly when repairing. ・ Do not attach kitchen knives that do not match the size. It will be damaged and you will be injured. ・ If not installed correctly, you may be seriously injured. ・ Immediately after mounting, check that there is no looseness or rattling before using a kitchen knife. ・ Check the installation condition regularly. ・ We do not take any responsibility for injuries or serious accidents caused by using this product.Caution! There is no blade","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+lu+au8RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Konatu","source_asin":"B08SBLKJC5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SBLKJC5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SBLKJC5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
