window.products.push({"id":1076525,"name":"Govin 2PCS Expandable Silverware Organizer for Kitchen Drawers, Silverware tray, Smart Kitchen Utensil Organizer, Flatware Cutlery Organizer, Multipur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818U1lsDaPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【EXCELLENT QUALITY】: Our durable and expandable drawer organizer is exclusively made out of high quality food-grade plastic. Commonly used for kitchenware, it is essential that they are non-toxic, BPA-free and do not emit a pungent odor so as to not leech harmful chemicals to its content. It is also easier to clean as compared to wooden storage organizers that could result in mildew. Not to mention, its matte finishing exudes a premium outlook for your kitchen drawers! ✅【INNOVATIVE】: Our unique and compact design is great for maximizing your drawer space. The adjustable feature can fit most drawers’ configurations (deep, shallow, wide or narrow) and according to your organizational preference. Its angled design promotes easy access, especially convenient for refillables. Constructed to be stackable with a non-slip base, it is a space-saving storage solution for small and narrow spaces. ✅【HIGH CAPACITY】: Measuring at 15.75\" (L) x 6.70\" (W) x 2.36\" (H), our tray organizer consists of eight angled compartments with one long expandable space - essentially combining what is usually stored in two drawers, can now be organized into one. The expanded compartment can store longer and wider utensils or gadgets up to 15.75\" (L) x 11.62” (W), giving it the ability to store a full set of cutlery that is easily sorted and neatly stored. ✅【WIDE APPLICATION】: Our versatile expandable drawer organizer comes in multiple compartments with various sizes - making it an ideal storage organizer to hold more than just kitchen cutlery and utensils. It is also suitable for sorting stationeries, crafting materials, office supplies, toiletries, cosmetics, jewelries as well as tech gadgets and accessories. Practically perfect for home, school and office use. ✅【SATISFACTION GUARANTEED】: Each expandable cutlery drawer organizer we sell is inspected carefully and packaged well to ensure that it is safe and of the highest quality. If for any reason you feel that it does not meet your expectations, do reach out to us and we will get things right for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818U1lsDaPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Govin","source_asin":"B094QH7JGB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094QH7JGB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094QH7JGB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
