window.products.push({"id":1076558,"name":"Schloß 63Qt Truck Portable Refrigerator, 12V/DC RV Fridge, 110V/AC Freezer for Home and Camping 0℉ to +50℉, Portable Fridge, Single Zone with Basket, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V5t4DJBUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: Large Storage Space: 60L Freezer Size 24.5x16.7x21.1 inches, Internal Capacity 56L, single-zone freezer. Fast Cooling, no ice required: -4°F(-20°C) powerful fast cooling performance, Temperature range: -4℉ to 50℉. No matter you want to keep food frozen or keep fresh, the Schloß 60L Car Portable Refrigerator will meet most of your needs. Widely used in Trucks, RV, Heavy trucks, Home, Yacht .: It's widely used in most trucks, 12/24V voltage, it does have plenty of room for several days meals. And Schloß Fridge also provides you with an AC adaptor, so you can use it at home while it is a family party. LCD Display: Temperature adjustable with LCD display, Fahrenheit and Celsius fast switch. Rapid cooling(MAX) and ECO save energy mode, 3 Levels of battery protection: low, middle, and high for 12V or 24V, Built-in LED light, and one internal basket(easy for carrying). One drain inside, easy clean. Top Open Door: Removable door, also can hold on either length sides. Reliable sealing property construction, and shockproof, continues to keep cooling performance during your journey. Fresh all way and super energy saving!Model#: GF60SExterior Dimensions:25.4 x 16.7x21.1 inchesCapacity:60LInternal Capacity:56LInstalled power: 60WNet Weight: 41.4LbsRated Voltage:12v/24vRated current:7.0A/3.5ATemperature setting:-4℉ to 50℉(-20℃ to 10℃)Package:1 X Schloß GF60S Fridge for Truck 1 X 2.5m DC power cord(12/24V)1 X 3.5m Extension Cable(12/24V)1 X Adapter for AC power1 X Adapter AC cable1 X Instruction bookWhy You Need A Schloß Portable Fridge Freezer?Half of all campers identified their “love of the outdoors” as the reason for their interest in camping. If you’re an avid camper, then you probably have a good idea of all the camping essentials. What you maybe haven’t thought too much about is adding a portable fridge freezer to that list. Here are three reasons why you should invest in one today!No Ice Necessary: You don’t need to buy ice. This is where a portable fridge freezer comes into play. Typically, a portable fridge freezer is equipped with a 12V plugin application for your vehicle or camper. Fridge freezers are capable of keeping all of your food and drink items ice cold and even frozen for as long as you have a power supply. It is cheaper in the long run than continually buying ice when you need it. Durability:That bag of ice you bought at the nearest gas station might last in your cooler for a few hours, maybe? However, hard coolers are susceptible to mold and interior deterioration. This is due to the inability to keep a regulated cool temperature. So a portable fridge freezer that uses a power supply only needs to be cleaned every so often compared to a hard-sided cooler that you should probably clean out after each use, or whenever you dump out all that water from your melted ice.Portable:Of course, it’s in the name! Isn’t it great that you can have that with your food and drink while on the go? Having a Schloß portable fridge freezer gives you that ease of access whenever you want your water, juice, milk, etc. as well as your fruit, cheese, or other car camping snacks. If you haven’t already looked, it might be time to up your camping game by investing in a portable fridge freezer!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V5t4DJBUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Schloß","source_asin":"B08FXPKMQ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FXPKMQ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FXPKMQ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
