window.products.push({"id":1076595,"name":"SlipX Solutions Microban-Infused Non-Slip Adhesive Safety Treads | Anti-Slip Bathroom Accessories - Bathtub, Shower, Pool, Boat, & Stair Tread Sticker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wv1JcCNML._AC_SL1005_.jpg","description":"Safety Treads: The must have bathroom accessory that's perfect for kids and seniors that is the only shower tread designed with Microban technology to prevent unwanted buildup and odor from soapy messes. These floor grips improve traction and safety on all kinds of slippery surfaces for the whole family. Prevents Unwanted Buildup & Smell: Microban protection works at a cellular level to continually disrupt the creation and reproduction of unwanted buildup that typically contaminates bathroom shower treads. The technology operates a multi-modal attack by damaging the protein, cell membrane, DNA, and internal systems, causing it to die. Power Grip Adhesive: SlipX Solutions' anti-slip shower and bathtub stickers have a secure hold to smooth, non-textured surfaces. Once adhered, these shower treads are simple to clean and provide a long-lasting, reliable grip that can last for years without having to be replaced. Versatile Uses: These universal non-slip safety sticker treads can be used in bathtubs, showers, hot tubs, boats, stairs and more! WARNING: Designed for use on smooth surfaces only. For your safety, do not install over grout lines, voids or textured/uneven surfaces; all of which negatively affect adhesion. This product is not intended for use on refinished surfaces. Always make sure that your mat is securely attached before entering or exiting your tub, shower or other slippery areas. No anti-slip product can prevent all accidents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wv1JcCNML._AC_SL1005_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SlipX Solutions","source_asin":"B09VNBKHW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VNBKHW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VNBKHW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
