window.products.push({"id":1076729,"name":"Rihe DIY Oil Painting Paint By Numbers Kits with Brushes and Acrylic Pigment for Adults Kids Beginner - Travelling 16x20 Inch(Wooden framed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JZS8vDa0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Enhance Relationship: Do you want to enhance the relationship with your children, lovers or friends by doing one thing together? Paint by numbers kits is a good choice for family activities. If you paint the painting with them, you can share the fun of painting with your lover and children. ✅Good Learning Toy: As a useful educational tool, it can enhance children’s color perception and it has been proven to help children focus and increase patience. After completing their DIY oil painting kit, they will have a sense of achievement, which is good for their intelligence and confidence. ✅Help Decompression: It’s a known fact that painting is used as a healing therapy and relieve stress, so if you want to release pressure through painting, this product will help you to relax yourself and decrease your stress in your free time, just enjoy creating a stunning work of art. ✅Special Gift: This is a great gift choice for Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, New Year, Birthday or other important days. This DIY Oil Painting can also be an excellent decoration in your home, kitchen, hotel and restaurant. ✅Package Includes: Our DIY paint by number canvas kit contains everything you need to complete this painting, including 1 pcs 16 x 20 inches pre-printed textured canvas (with wooden framed), a set of acrylic paints, 1 set brushes (include 3pcs), 1 reference picture of final works and 2 hooks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JZS8vDa0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RIHE","source_asin":"B01LY7KZI0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LY7KZI0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LY7KZI0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1076730,"name":"R.W.FLAME Tower Fan with Remote Control, Standing fan for office, Oscillating fan for home with children/pets/elders, Time Settings,LCD display,45W, O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mGylwGhhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Different Wind modes and Speeds】 3 wind modes, normal/natural/sleep mode. You can set the wind modes and speeds according to your needs. High speed brings you Strong winds to relieve your heat quickly; Middle speed provides natural comfortable wind which accompanies you when you read book, watch TV or work; Low speed is more suitable for sleeping, the elderly and children can also sleep peacefully with our tower fan. 【LCD Display and Electronic remote control】 The clear LCD interface and simple remote control make it easy to use our tower fan. You can adjust the tower fan by pressing the button on the top or the remote control, and you can see the work status of tower fan in real time and Current room temperature on the LCD interface. You can also use the remote control to start or adjust the fan from a distance of 6 meters.Wide time range 1~12H meets the needs of most people. 【Aerodynamics interactive experience】Using aerodynamic technology, tower fans allow air to flow throughout the house. When the tower fan and air conditioner are used together, with the sway of the tower fan, no matter where you are in the room, you can feel the cool wind, thus saving electricity. 【Space Saver】 Standing 46 inch , with a small 8.66*7.48 inch footprint, This vertical slim tower fan is really a space saver which can power enough wind to beat the heat, bringing you cool breeze during hot weather. Weighing 11.46 lbs, you can easily move the fan and place it anywhere in the room as you like. 【Safe for Family】The steady base provide the unit against falling. It is much safer in the family with pets and children due to the bladeless design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mGylwGhhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"R.W.FLAME","source_asin":"B08TWS792N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TWS792N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TWS792N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
