window.products.push({"id":1076991,"name":"20 Pack 4x6 Magnetic Picture Frames for 4 X 6 Inch Photo Plastic Refrigerator Insert Holder Sleeve Pocket by Freeze-a-frame Made in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8115HUunP9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Freez-A-Frame Magnetic Photo Holder 4\" x 6\" 20 Pack from Howard Packaging will never leave you out in the cold. It will hold itself rock-steady to your refrigerator, school locker, filing cabinet or any other flat metal surface. The open-pocket design of these little frames make photos, whether from digital or film, both easy to insert and easy to remove when its time to change the picture. You'll find Freez-a-Frames perfect for setting up your refrigerator gallery of family, friends and the dogs and cats. Pictures will not fall out like acrylic frames.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8115HUunP9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yinat","source_asin":"B077H18ZJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077H18ZJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077H18ZJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1076992,"name":"Cheers to 80 Years Banner, 80th Birthday Decorations for Women and Men, Gold Glitter Banner with Free 3.2 ft x 9.8 ft Metallic Tinsel Foil Fringe Curt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BACvO0zXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"GREAT PRICE FOR THE PACK - Save almost $8 if you buy the banner and metallic tinsel foil fringe curtains separately. Shining metallic tinsel backdrops are reusable. Can be a photo backdrop for birthday, graduation, wedding, baby showers, new year eve and other parties or festivals occasion. GOLDEN MEMORY KIT - No party is complete without a birthday banner to celebrate the special guest of honor as well as welcoming guests to the fun event. Cheers to 80 years banner and sparkly gold metallic tinsel foil fringe streamer curtain are the perfect combination as a backdrop for party photo booth props. It will help you grip the golden memory with the very person. PREMIUM PRODUCT QUALITY - Party banner is made of ECO-Friendly paper. The rope is 9.8 ft long enough to hang anywhere you want. Letters of each word are linked together. The space of each work is adjustable. Use high-quality glitter cardstock to make circle dots garland. Shine under light & no glitter falling off. Come with 2 pieces glittery paper garlands. 6.5ft long of each. PRE STRUNG - Tired of spending your precious time string the birthday banner before birthday party? This is it! No assembly required from Lamdico, way more convenient! Simply unfold and use the strings to hang, then fold back up when finished. GUARANTEE - We stand by our banners with a 100% money back guarantee. If this birthday banner does not make you and your loved ones smile, then your money back - It's That Simple. (CLEVER TIPS, Using scotch tape to hang on metallic gold tinsel foil fringe curtains is easier to clean to protect the home decent wall.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BACvO0zXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lamdico","source_asin":"B07P772S5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P772S5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P772S5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1076993,"name":"EchosLife 20x28 LED Bathroom Mirrors for Wall -Black Aluminum Framed (Front and Backlit), Anti-Fog Vanity Mirror With Lights,Stepless Dimmable Lighted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617rmcXp9XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Luxurious Design] EchosLife is perfect choice for high-end bathroom remodel that promotes peace and relaxation, positively impacting your mental health and well-being and providing refreshing start to your day. [Space Black Aluminum Frame] Unlike other large LED bathroom mirrors, EchosLife's mirrors feature modern space black aluminum frames that create sophisticated atmospheres and add authentic touch of luxury. [Incredible Brightness] Front and backlit designs illuminate your bathroom perfectly for makeup application, shaving, and grooming. You can choose from 3 color temperatures (ranging from 3000K warm light to 6000K cool daylight) and step-less dimming (from 10% to 100%) with higher CRI (90+). [Anti-Fog & Water-Proof] Tired of coming out of the shower to fogged-up bathroom mirrors that you have to wipe with your towel? Fogless function has you covered, providing clear visibility even in steamy environments. [Shatter-Proof & Anticorrosive] 5mm copper-free black frame mirror are excellent options for bathroom spaces. These shatter-proof glass mirrors resist moisture and damage, providing uncompromising reflection and quality that will last years. [Touch Sensors & Memory] Lighted touch buttons make operation a breeze, and intelligent memory functions will remember your preferred lighting settings, even after turning the mirror off and on. [Plugin or Hard-Wired] 2 installation methods are available. Plug-in framed bathroom mirrors can be easily hardwired by electricians if you prefer to avoid trailing cables. [Ease of Assembly] EchosLife's lighted bathroom mirror features excellent mounting systems with typical \"ledge\" design that will never dislodge, making installation a breeze. [3 Years Warranty] If the mirror you received is defective or has any problems during use, please do not hesitate to contact EchosLife's Amazon after-sales service team. We value you as our customer and will do our utmost to make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617rmcXp9XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EchosLife","source_asin":"B0BQJ8BCZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQJ8BCZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQJ8BCZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1076994,"name":"Halloween Pumpkin Carving Kit, Halloween Jack-O-Lanterns 13 Piece Professional pumpkin cutting supplies tools Kit with 6 Pumpkin LED Candles, Pumpkin ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iLrvdpQSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Distinctive Knife Tip】The shape of the knife tip has its own characteristics, and its functions are different，cutting, engraving, digging and carving. Each knife have their own strengths. Let the pumpkin become a work of art in your hands. A set of 13 knives, of which 6 carving knives are double-headed design, which is equivalent to your possession of 19 pumpkin carving tools with 5 x carving stencils and 6 x LED Candles Lights. 【High-quality Material】 All cutters are made of high-quality stainless steel heads, of which 8 have high-quality wooden handles and 5 are high-quality plastic handles. The handle is reasonably designed and feels comfortable. The handle is well-made, firm, stable and smooth. The blade is firmly fixed to the handle, so there is no need to worry about it breaking, and children can easily use it. 【Portable and Durable】 Halloween carving knife is equipped with a canvas storage bag, simple and stylish, durable and wear-resistant, convenient to store and carry. There is an elastic band in the storage bag to fix the knives, which can easily store and organize these sharp tools without injury. 【Halloween Essentials】 With pumpkin carving tools, you can carve pumpkins faster and easier, create an outstanding and interesting decorations to the whole family, enjoy a wonderful Halloween. Every child will not refuse to create his own Halloween Jack-O-Lantern. 【Reminder】The engraving tool can be used year after year, and it can also be used daily. These carving tools are not suitable for children under 9 years old, children aged 10 to 15 require adult supervision. Please be careful when using these carving tools.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iLrvdpQSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nobie vivid","source_asin":"B08CVDSJ9B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1076994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CVDSJ9B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CVDSJ9B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
